<BRK/>
<LST><SUB>SD-10 Operation and Maintenance Data</SUB></LST><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM><SUB>Grit Handling System</SUB>, Data Package 3; <SUB>G<TAI OPT="ARMY">, [_____]</TAI></SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
